sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: Unavailable<br>Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to change the availability<br>of the specified components to Inoperative

    CSMS->>CS: ChangeAvailabilityRequest (operationalStatus = Inoperative, evse = specified evseId)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 1): ChangeAvailabilityRequest<br>- operationalStatus Inoperative<br>- evse <Specified evseId><br>- connectorId omitted

    CS-->>CSMS: ChangeAvailabilityResponse (status = Accepted)

    loop For all connectors belonging to the specified EVSE (and optionally the EVSE itself)
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Unavailable)
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Unavailable, component.name = ChargingStation / EVSE / Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
        CSMS-->>CS: CSMS responds accordingly (StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse)
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: State is Unavailable
